HYPOTHESIS CONCLUSIONS
================================================================================

from_exp1:
  - PARTIAL SUPPORT for H1/H2: Attn2 helps but MLP2 also works
  - WARNING: H3 possible - head-only probe achieves reasonable R²
  - R1 (Block2-only) R² = 0.9551
  - R2 (Attn2-only) R² = 0.9528
  - R3 (MLP2-only) R² = 0.8611

exp2_R1:
  {'H1': False, 'H2': True}

exp3_R1:
  {'H3': False, 'reason': 'Model robust to token replacement (replace: 0.041, freq_swap: 0.191)'}

exp6_R1:
  {'H4': False, 'reason': 'Norms weakly predictive (R²=0.818) or LN ablation has small effect (-0.002)'}

